{"id":"lem:finite-net-propensity-rate","kind":"lemma","statement":"Let \(\mathscr P^{\mathrm{vs,H}}_{\sigma_\star,t_\pi,L_\pi}\) be the structural H\"older-propensity subclass in \(\texttt{def:holder-propensity-triangular-law-class}\).  On every training complement use the clipped finite-net least-squares learner specified in \(\texttt{def:propensity-rate-regimes}\).  Then, uniformly over \(\mathbf P\in\mathscr P^{\mathrm{vs,H}}_{\sigma_\star,t_\pi,L_\pi}\),
\[
\max_{1\le k\le K}\lVert\bar\pi_{-k,n}-\pi_n\rVert_{L^2(P_{X,n})}
=O_{P_n}\!\left(n^{-t_\pi/(2t_\pi+d_X)}\right).
\]","depends_on":["ass:observed-iid","ass:fixed-overlap","ass:holder-propensity","def:propensity-rate-regimes"],"status":"to-prove"}

